window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Aster Wildes is not only a witch on a mission, she's about to be a mother.</b></p> <p>In one tragic event, Aster lost everything she treasured most—the home she fought so hard to keep and the vampire who had stolen her heart.</p> <p>But Aster is no quitter. Once her daughter is born, she'll risk everything to resurrect her vampire, even when there's no guarantee such a dangerous spell will work.</p> <p>When an unexpected twist of fate upends her entire plan, Aster's forced to run from New Orleans to California just weeks before giving birth. It's there that she must create the most forbidden and perilous spell of her life. Because if her coven found out the truth about her child, they'd turn their back on her in a heartbeat. Getting caught could mean burning at the stake, and her enemies are lurking in the shadows.</p> <p>With her life and love on the line, Aster must attempt to break the toxic pattern of her ancestors and create the life her child deserves.</p> <p><i>Contains mature content. A complete list of content warnings can be found on the author's website.</i></p>"; 
